Profile: MII_PR_PRO_Questionnaire_Adaptive
Parent: MII_PR_PRO_Questionnaire
Id: mii-pr-pro-questionnaire-adaptive
Title: "MII PR PRO Questionnaire Adaptive"
Description: "MII PR PRO Adaptive Questionnaire (Item Bank) for Computer Adaptive Testing. Extends the base MII Questionnaire profile with CAT-specific metadata (questionnaireAdaptive extension). Note: This profile is for the definition-level item bank, NOT for the runtime contained questionnaire in an adaptive QuestionnaireResponse (which uses sdc-questionnaire-adapt with url 0..0)."

* extension contains http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-questionnaireAdaptive named questionnaireAdaptive 1..1 MS
